ct 2）。\n*   **应用层根因**：Elasticsearch 日志聚合显示在 `/work` 路径反复出现 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误（Fact 4），Tracing 数据也通过 `aiops.observed_mode: config_missing_exit` 属性证实了这一路径上的拒绝行为（Fact 5）。\n*   **已知未知**：现有事实未指明 `workload-code` ConfigMap 中具体缺失的键名（如特定的 Key 或环境变量），因此根因定位在应用层的校验逻辑触发，而非具体的缺失参数名称。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 24.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 100.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx: 100.2s (Evidence 91.9s, RCA 8.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 138.14, "metrics": {"run_id": "68d656ea67be48fe", "mttr": {"value": "2.3m", "seconds": 138.1415753364563, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "44%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "d